<p class="answer"><strong>Straight answer:</strong> switch a wet phone off straight away, don't charge it, and bring it to InstaTech London at 67 Marchmont Street (Bloomsbury) or 16 City Road (Moorgate) as soon as you can. We open the phone, clean out the liquid and corrosion, test each part and tell you what can be saved before any repair work starts. The diagnostic is free, and if we can't fix it you pay nothing. Water resistance is not waterproofing, so a phone can still be damaged by a drop in water or a spill. If the phone won't turn on, we can check your photos and contacts first.</p>
