<section class="sec rvl" id="itx-symptoms">
<div class="sechead">
<div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--sky)">First aid</div>
<h2>Tap what happened</h2>
<p>The first hour matters most. Here is what to do, and what not to do, before you bring it in.</p>
</div>
<div class="chk">
<div class="chips" id="itx-chips" role="group" aria-label="Symptoms"><button class="chip" aria-pressed="true" data-i="0">Just dropped it in water</button><button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-i="1">Spilled a drink on it</button><button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-i="2">Moisture warning when charging</button><button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-i="3">Working, but acting strangely</button><button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-i="4">Won't turn on</button></div>
<div class="verdict" id="itx-verdict" aria-live="polite">
<div class="vpane on" data-i="0"><span class="tag"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3s6 6.5 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.5 6-11 6-11z"/></svg> Act now</span>
<h3>Switch it off and keep it off</h3>
<p>Take it out, power it off, and don't charge it or press buttons to test it. Remove the case and SIM tray, dry the outside with a lint-free cloth and bring it in. Skip the rice: it doesn't draw water out of the phone and can leave dust and starch in the ports.</p>
<div class="row"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg> Bring it in today</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12l4 4L19 6"/></svg> Free diagnostic</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.5 8.5-7 10-3.5-1.5-7-5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg> Warranty</span></div>
</div>
<div class="vpane" data-i="1"><span class="tag"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3s6 6.5 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.5 6-11 6-11z"/></svg> Sugary or salty liquid</span>
<h3>Drinks corrode faster than water</h3>
<p>Coffee, juice, beer and sea water leave sugar and salt behind, which corrode the board faster than clean water. Switch it off, don't charge it, and bring it in as soon as you can so we can clean the residue out.</p>
<div class="row"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg> Bring it in today</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12l4 4L19 6"/></svg> Free diagnostic</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.5 8.5-7 10-3.5-1.5-7-5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg> Warranty</span></div>
</div>
<div class="vpane" data-i="2"><span class="tag"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 2v5M15 2v5M7 7h10v4a5 5 0 0 1-10 0zM12 16v6"/></svg> Charging port</span>
<h3>Unplug it and let the port dry</h3>
<p>A moisture warning means liquid is sitting in the port. Unplug the cable and don't force it to charge. If the warning stays once the phone is dry, the port may be corroding. See our <a href="/mobile-repair-services/charging-port-repair/">charging port repair</a>.</p>
<div class="row"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12l4 4L19 6"/></svg> Free diagnostic</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 2v5M15 2v5M7 7h10v4a5 5 0 0 1-10 0zM12 16v6"/></svg> Port cleaned first</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.5 8.5-7 10-3.5-1.5-7-5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg> Warranty</span></div>
</div>
<div class="vpane" data-i="3"><span class="tag"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l9 16H3z"/><path d="M12 10v4M12 17h.01"/></svg> Hidden damage</span>
<h3>Working now doesn't mean it's fine</h3>
<p>Speakers, cameras, Face ID and the screen can fail days later as corrosion spreads. If your phone got wet and is now glitching, back it up and bring it in for the free diagnostic before more parts are affected.</p>
<div class="row"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg> Bring it in today</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="7" ry="3"/><path d="M5 6v12c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3V6M5 12c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3"/></svg> Data checked first</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.5 8.5-7 10-3.5-1.5-7-5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg> Warranty</span></div>
</div>
<div class="vpane" data-i="4"><span class="tag"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v8M6.3 6.3a8 8 0 1 0 11.4 0"/></svg> No power</span>
<h3>Don't keep trying to switch it on</h3>
<p>Repeatedly powering a wet phone can short the board. Leave it off and bring it in. We check the board and the battery, and if the phone can't be saved we can tell you whether your photos and contacts can be recovered.</p>
<div class="row"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg> Bring it in today</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="7" ry="3"/><path d="M5 6v12c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3V6M5 12c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3"/></svg> Data checked first</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12l4 4L19 6"/></svg> Free diagnostic</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
